Service recovery says recovery was attempted, and a failed record is reported

This commit carries only service_answering/recover.rs, under a message written for the janitor change that follows it. It makes the module and the alert say recovery was attempted, the report say the event is listed by stado service recoveries only if recording succeeds, and a failed append of the recovery record come back as recording_refusal in the report rather than failing a recovery whose alert was already sent. The janitor change is the next commit; the commit after it restores this file, which that commit had carried back.

